      "reviewer_kind": "online",
      "output": "Ah Q's name and place of origin are obscure, and even his past deeds are vague. For the people of Weizhuang, as long as he helps them, they only want his help and make fun of him; they never pay attention to his deeds. Nor did Ah Q himself speak of it, but when he argued with others, he occasionally glared and said, \"We were once much better off than you! What are you?\"",
